          "-                <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">v2.1.220&ndash;2.1.219: Opus 5 default, security, background agent, a11y improvements</a></div>",
          "-                <div class=\"item-desc\">",
          "-                    10+ releases: Claude Opus 5 is the new default Opus model (1M context, 128K output). Background <code>/code-review</code> as a subagent, <code>/fork</code> creating background sessions, nested subagents up to depth 3, emoji shortcode autocomplete, sandbox.network.strictAllowlist. Critical fixes: Windows path corruption bug, quadratic slowdown, prompt-caching billing regression.",
