          "-                    Following acquisition by Cursor (Anysphere) in mid-June 2026, all cloud user data was permanently deleted. GitHub repo marked read-only. Final release v2.0.0-vscode (June 19). Codebase remains available under Apache 2.0.",
          "-                </div>",
          "-                <div class=\"feedback\">",
