          "+            <p class=\"item-desc\">Enterprise admins get a visual dashboard grouping users into adoption cohorts (Code-first, Agent-first, Multi-agent, Passive) with metrics like average PRs merged per user, median PR merge velocity, and 6-month trend charts.</p>",
