          "-                <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/24/#introducing-claude-opus-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Opus 5 leads Artificial Analysis leaderboard, ahead of Fable 5</a></div>",
          "-                <div class=\"insight-desc\">Described as &ldquo;thoughtful and proactive.&rdquo; Fast mode at 2x cost. Anthropic published a prompting guide; Thariq Shihipar wrote on context engineering for Claude 5 generation.</div>",
          "-                <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison &middot; 2026-07-24</div>",
          "-            </article>",
