          "+            <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>",
          "+            <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://docs.devin.ai/desktop/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Devin Desktop v3.5.17: Cloud session performance, Fast Context, hooks migration</a></div>",
          "+            <p class=\"item-desc\">Faster rendering for long cloud sessions, inline network policy configuration, Fast Context support in Devin Local, hooks tab in Customizations, instant worktree-backed sessions, and a command to migrate Windsurf hooks into Devin hooks.</p>",
