          "+            <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rust-v0.144.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">v0.144.6: Bundled instructions for GPT-5.6 Sol/Terra/Luna context windows</a></div>",
          "+            <p class=\"item-desc\">Refreshed bundled instructions for GPT-5.6 Sol, Terra, and Luna models, and corrected their context windows to 272,000 tokens. Ensures proper model behavior and accurate context handling.</p>",
