          "-                <div class=\"insight-desc\">Survey reveals 96% of developers have adopted AI coding tools, marking the shift from novelty to core infrastructure.</div>",
          "-                <div class=\"insight-author\">Software Engineering Daily &middot; 2026-07-23</div>",
          "-            </article>",
