          "+            <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cursor in Slack: multi-repo, cross-channel workflows, plan-first</a></div>",
          "+            <p class=\"item-desc\">Cursor now shares a plan before starting work, supports named multi-repo environments from Slack, can read from and post to other Slack channels and threads. UI refinements include compact footer links and cleaner table/PR rendering.</p>",
          "+            <div class=\"item-meta\"><span class=\"date\">2026-07-17</span></div>",
