          "+            <span class=\"product-label\">GitHub Copilot</span>",
          "+            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>",
          "+            <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-07-14-github-copilot-for-jetbrains-expands-byok-capabilities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">JetBrains BYOK expansion + AI security detections on PRs</a></div>",
          "+            <p class=\"item-desc\">OpenAI-compatible custom endpoint support, Claude agent provider customizations (preview), local sandboxing (preview), built-in debugger skill. Also added AI-powered code scanning on PRs and /security-review in the Copilot app (preview).</p>",
          "+            <div class=\"item-meta\"><span class=\"date\">2026-07-14</span></div>",
          "+        </div>",
          " ",
          "-            <article class=\"insight-item\">",
          "-                <div class=\"insight-type\">Opinion</div>",
          "-                <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Jul/20/#coding-agents-reverse-engineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Coding agents are changing the economics of reverse engineering</a></div>",
          "-                <div class=\"insight-desc\">The reduced cost of writing code means trying and failing carries less psychological baggage. Maintaining automation code is now cheap enough to be disposable.</div>",
          "-                <div class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison &middot; 2026-07-20</div>",
          "-            </article>",
          "+        <!-- Copilot Autofix -->",
          "+        <div class=\"item-card update-card\">",
          "+            <span class=\"product-label\">GitHub Copilot</span>",
          "+            <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>",
          "+            <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/2026-07-10-agentic-autofix-for-code-scanning-alerts-in-public-preview/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Agentic Autofix for Code Scanning Alerts (Public Preview)</a></div>",
          "+            <p class=\"item-desc\">A fully agentic Autofix powered by the Copilot cloud agent that autonomously creates fixes for CodeQL alerts. Supports multi-file remediation, validates fixes by rerunning analysis, and can auto-generate PRs. Typically 2–4 minutes per fix.</p>",
          "+            <div class=\"item-meta\"><span class=\"date\">2026-07-10</span></div>",
