          "-                <div class=\"insight-desc\">Proposed releasing a GPT-3-level model locally to &ldquo;discourage others from releasing similarly-powerful models&rdquo;&mdash;contrasting sharply with OpenAI's later positioning.</div>",
          "-                <div class=\"insight-author\">Sam Altman / S. Willison &middot; 2026-07-20</div>",
